[PrintTextModified Text:——监牢生活第二轮，第××天。|#0204Adv15_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——远野汉娜杀害了樱羽艾玛与莲见蕾雅，<br>作为魔女被处刑了。|#0204Adv15_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我之所以还没有完全崩溃，<br>还能保持理智不失，是因为……|#0204Adv15_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——内心某处觉得，<br>我必须见证真相。|#0204Adv15_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——只要见到真相，<br>再重新来过就好。|#0204Adv15_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——只要用我的魔法，<br>就能回到今天早上，将一切重来。|#0204Adv15_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:钢笔书写的声音<br>戛然而止。|#0204Adv15_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我写不下去了。|#0204Adv15_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:"（汉娜从第一次见到蕾雅开始，<br>　就已经产生了恨意）|#0204Adv15_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（即使回到今天早上，<br>　也无法斩断长久累积的憎恶）|#0204Adv15_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:"（也许今天能救下艾玛和蕾雅。<br>　但无论怎么努力，蕾雅总有一天会被杀）|#0204Adv15_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Fearful1,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:（那么我是不是该……先把汉娜杀了？）|#0204Adv15_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:明明亲眼见证汉娜被处刑——也就是正义得以执行。<br>这应该让我感到释怀才对。|#0204Adv15_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我的心情却没有因此明朗起来。<br>|#0204Adv15_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:甚至觉得，这是错误的。|#0204Adv15_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Cry1,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:（我……我——！）|#0204Adv15_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 万年筆の折れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_151 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:我用力过猛，<br>竟折断了钢笔。|#0204Adv15_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆忌々しげに

[PrintTextModified Text:……可恶！这种东西……！|#0204Adv15_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 万年筆を床に投げ捨てる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_152 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,ArmR13,ArmL13

[PrintTextModified Text:我一直以为珍贵的事物……<br>原来全都是错的！|#0204Adv15_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我支撑不住身体，跪倒在地，<br>用拳头猛击地板。|#0204Adv15_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是、我是、我是——！|#0204Adv15_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:——错误的。|#0204Adv15_Yuki001| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不是我自己说出的话。<br>那声音不知从何处，伴随着阵阵轻声讥笑传来。|#0204Adv15_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

