[PrintTextModified Text:雪……？是你在、吗……？|#0204Adv15_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听见熟悉而虚幻的声音，<br>我茫然站起身。|#0204Adv15_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,ArmR13,ArmL13

[PrintTextModified Text:在哪！？到底在哪里！？|#0204Adv15_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我环顾室内，<br>却看不到她的身影。|#0204Adv15_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

