; 立ち絵・話者名の表示なし
[PrintTextModified Text:对了，还有。很遗憾，你已经无法重来了哦。|#0204Adv15_Yuki004| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为你的禁忌就是自杀吧。|#0204Adv15_Yuki005| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一旦你试图自杀，这次一定会触犯禁忌，<br>变成魔女。|#0204Adv15_Yuki006| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:丧失理性并化为残骸的你，<br>就算回到过去，也只会杀光所有人。|#0204Adv15_Yuki007| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而成为残骸，<br>就意味着失去魔法，再也无法使出死亡回溯。|#0204Adv15_Yuki008| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真遗憾呢。真可怜呢。<br>你真是，太可怜了。|#0204Adv15_Yuki009| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

