[PrintTextModified Text:住口——！！|#0204Adv15_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脑海里回响的耳语声，<br>似乎是从钢笔里发出来的。|#0204Adv15_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住口，住口，给我住口！！|#0204Adv15_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是我一次次踩碎钢笔，<br>直到它粉身碎骨。|#0204Adv15_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:别这么过分嘛。|#0204Adv15_Yuki010| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使我将钢笔彻底摧毁，<br>雪的耳语声依旧没有停止。|#0204Adv15_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这只钢笔里面倾注了你对我的感情，<br>用来附身最合适不过了。|#0204Adv15_Yuki011| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但就算无处附身……|#0204Adv15_Yuki012| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ※ここでヒントシステムのユキが喋りだす演出入れたいけど確定ではないので仮置き。

; ＠備考◆ささやき

[PrintTextModified Text:"【希 罗】|#0204Adv15_Yuki013|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ささやき

[PrintTextModified Text:【我会、一直、在你身边】|#0204Adv15_Yuki014| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆戦慄

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Fearful1,ArmR9,ArmL10

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
