[PrintTextModified Text:噫、啊、啊——！|#0204Adv15_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:捂住双耳、紧闭双眼、蜷缩起来。|#0204Adv15_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，她的耳语依然不断侵蚀我。|#0204Adv15_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
