@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000ff Duration:0.4 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:【只要还在这座监牢，我就能维持存在】|#0204Adv15_Yuki015| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"【一定是因为家人对我的思念之情<br>　还残留于此吧】|#0204Adv15_Yuki016|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"【……喂，希罗。<br>　艾玛被杀了】|#0204Adv15_Yuki017|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"【我真的很失望。<br>　又得从头去找替代品了】|#0204Adv15_Yuki018|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"【你会帮我的吧？<br>　毕竟我们是朋友呀】|#0204Adv15_Yuki019|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,ArmR13,ArmL13

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0.4 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:朋友……？别开玩笑了！|#0204Adv15_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:月代雪——你就是一切的元凶！|#0204Adv15_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我竟然一直以来……<br>都把你当作重要的朋友！|#0204Adv15_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来我一直都是错的！！<br>一错再错，错到现在！！|#0204Adv15_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、小雪，还有我。|#0204Adv15_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们三人共度的初中时代，<br>我曾视若珍宝的回忆，<br>全部轰然崩塌。|#0204Adv15_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

