@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_32_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:刚上初中没多久，<br>就有个女孩遭受了残酷霸凌。|#0204Adv15_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的名字叫月代雪。|#0204Adv15_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我放不下她，<br>渐渐开始保护她。|#0204Adv15_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但小雪却厌恶着试图保护她的我，<br>甚至冷淡避开。|#0204Adv15_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，我仍然坚持成为她的盾。<br>因为我认为，这才是正确的行动。|#0204Adv15_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:400_1

[PrintTextModified Text:直到某天，我看到小雪和艾玛走在一起。<br>|#0204Adv15_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自从升上初中后，我和艾玛不再同班，<br>两人关系便稍显疏远。|#0204Adv15_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见到小雪与艾玛亲密地笑着。|#0204Adv15_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——原来她交到朋友了。太好了。|#0204Adv15_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:同时，内心却涌上一股前所未有的相反感情。<br>|#0204Adv15_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——为什么我就不行？|#0204Adv15_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——为什么偏偏是艾玛？|#0204Adv15_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们两人的身影深深烙印在我心里，<br>怎么也挥之不去。|#0204Adv15_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我开始觉得艾玛根本不是个好孩子。<br>这份感情不断膨胀。|#0204Adv15_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在我不断留意她们的同时，<br>终于有一天，艾玛也察觉到了我的目光。|#0204Adv15_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——希罗也一起玩嘛。|#0204Adv15_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我若无其事地<br>握住了艾玛伸向我的手。|#0204Adv15_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:400_2

[PrintTextModified Text:由于小雪讨厌他人的目光，<br>我们三人越来越经常<br>在避人耳目的秘密基地聚会。|#0204Adv15_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:三个人在一起，<br>互相嬉闹，<br>一起玩游戏，|#0204Adv15_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:聊天，<br>吃零食，<br>偶尔吵架，|#0204Adv15_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:都是无可替代的珍贵回忆。|#0204Adv15_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……但是……|#0204Adv15_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:后来，因为我要去短期留学，<br>三人之间的关系开始发生变化。|#0204Adv15_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将小雪托付给了艾玛。<br>因为小雪在学校被霸凌的情况还是没有改善。|#0204Adv15_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——就拜托你照顾小雪了。|#0204Adv15_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——嗯，交给我吧！|#0204Adv15_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使平日里笑着装作若无其事的样子，<br>其实我心里一直嫉妒着艾玛。<br>|#0204Adv15_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:心中这小小的黑暗——|#0204Adv15_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:400_3

[PrintTextModified Text:在我回国得知小雪自杀后，<br>爆发式地膨胀起来。|#0204Adv15_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

