@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_29_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——我非常重要的朋友自杀了。|#0204Adv15_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但那只不过是<br>　她用来折磨艾玛的手段）|#0204Adv15_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她叫月代雪。|#0204Adv15_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她其实是大魔女）|#0204Adv15_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:4 Category:Note Version:2

[PrintTextModified Text:当我推开房门时，<br>那根上吊绳还静静地悬挂在原地。|#0204Adv15_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我抬头怒视那根为她准备好的绞索。|#0204Adv15_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如今我明白了。<br>　她是为了在艾玛心里留下心理创伤）|#0204Adv15_Hiro020|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将背脊挺得笔直，<br>视线穿过那为了扼住她的咽喉而存在的圆环——<br>过于刺眼的憎恶，让我咬紧了牙关。|#0204Adv15_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法原谅。<br>无法原谅小雪的生命，就这么被区区一根绳子夺走。|#0204Adv15_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她是为了对艾玛的心灵造成伤痛，<br>　故意遭到霸凌，<br>　故意自杀的）|#0204Adv15_Hiro021|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对我而言，这是不可饶恕的行为。<br>对我而言，这是不正确的行为。|#0204Adv15_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我被她骗得团团转，<br>　更进一步将艾玛逼入绝境）|#0204Adv15_Hiro022|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我最崇尚的就是【正确】。|#0204Adv15_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我正如月代雪所愿，<br>　被她玩弄于股掌之间，还甘之如饴）|#0204Adv15_Hiro023|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个世界上，<br>不该允许有哪怕一丝一毫的错误存在。|#0204Adv15_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我的一切都是错误的）|#0204Adv15_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:清澈的湖水中若是掺入一滴毒素，<br>生灵便会死绝。|#0204Adv15_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那滴毒药，是我）|#0204Adv15_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:精致的画布上若是划出一道划痕，<br>艺术的价值便随之泯灭。|#0204Adv15_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那道伤痕，是我）|#0204Adv15_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:完美的和声中若是混进一个错误的音符，<br>就会沦为刺耳的不协和音。|#0204Adv15_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那个错音，是我）|#0204Adv15_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:祈盼着正确的大脑中<br>若是寄生了一只害虫——|#0204Adv15_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那只害虫，是我）|#0204Adv15_Hiro028| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:整个世界，便会崩塌。|#0204Adv15_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——在绞索圆环的彼端，<br>我看见了造就这个错误世界的罪魁祸首。|#0204Adv15_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那就是我）|#0204Adv15_Hiro029| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是我、是我、是我、<br>　是我、是我、是我——）|#0204Adv15_Hiro030|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

