; ＠備考◆号泣

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊、啊啊啊啊啊、啊啊啊啊呜啊啊啊——！！|#0204Adv15_Hiro031| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我失去了一切。<br>我手中根本没有什么正义。<br>我是如此无力。|#0204Adv15_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没能拯救任何人。|#0204Adv15_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只能不住呜咽，<br>不断痛哭。|#0204Adv15_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆号泣

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、呜呜呜、啊啊……<br>啊啊、啊啊！|#0204Adv15_Hiro032| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 暗転
; ========================================

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000ff Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv15_Hiro033| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——不知道自己哭了多久。|#0204Adv15_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知何时起，雪的气息已消失无踪。<br>她大概对我这个人从头到尾都无所谓吧。|#0204Adv15_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:眼泪早已干涸，<br>唯有泪痕冰冷地贴在脸颊上。|#0204Adv15_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗓子只能发出沙哑的气音，<br>眼睛也失去光芒变得浑浊。|#0204Adv15_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:空虚在胸腔深处扎根、蔓延，<br>只余下残破的感情和一片静寂。|#0204Adv15_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:铁栅栏外模模糊糊看见一双脚。<br>|#0204Adv15_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊啊，对了，还有几个少女<br>　存活下来……）|#0204Adv15_Hiro034|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（不过，她们恐怕也……）|#0204Adv15_Hiro035| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:3 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:3.2

[PrintTextModified Text:我迟钝地抬起头。<br>透过铁栅望着我的，是亚里沙和米莉亚。|#0204Adv15_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是听见我撕心裂肺的哭声，<br>她们才没有出声打扰。|#0204Adv15_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:隔着铁栅栏，她们略显不安，<br>担忧地望着我。|#0204Adv15_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……二阶堂，我有个东西想给你看看。<br>|#0204Adv15_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:给我看？事到如今，还能有什么……|#0204Adv15_Hiro036| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你还很难受，也不必勉强自己。<br>但……大叔我们<br>也只是想尽一点心意，希望能帮帮你……|#0204Adv15_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这东西到底能不能帮上你的忙，其实大叔我也不确定。<br>但……别再哭了，好吗？|#0204Adv15_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我摇摇晃晃地站起身，走出牢房。|#0204Adv15_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大脑已无法思考更多，只是机械地跟着她们。|#0204Adv15_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

